        "detailed_description": "<h1>PUBLISH YOUR GAMES WITH US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/087a625b734d3385cefd1f6e43daa848.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/4b7fa70bc5bc85a3fd831ec4b39998a3.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This is a Job Simulator. Yes, you will be working — a lot!</h2>If you're looking for action, quick thrills or casual gameplay... this might not be for you. But if you enjoy attention to detail, routine, and challenge — welcome to the job.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This game contains jumpscares.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This game is based on the universe of another game by the same creator, Doll Impostor. Dolls, boxes, robots, and other elements share the same models, names, and assets. When Doll Impostor is updated, this game will also receive updates, such as new dolls, boxes, and more.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode: Your 30-Day Trial Begins</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.poster.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.webm?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.mp4?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You've just been hired by Doll INC, the mysterious factory behind the production of Doll Impostor dolls.<br>You have 30 trial days to prove you're fit for the job.<br>Each day brings new tasks, tools, and choices that will test your obedience.<br>Will you follow orders… or dare to disobey?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Job Simulator: Inspect, Scan, Survive</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.poster.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.webm?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.mp4?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience a unique job simulator: inspect products, scan for defects, operate tools, and detect hidden anomalies.<br>You’ll work with dolls, boxes, and robots—nothing and no one is free from flaws.<br>Learn fast. Act with precision. Your future depends on your performance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Modes: Beyond the Trial</h2>✔️ Worker Mode: endless routine.<br>✔️ Time Attack: speed up, but don’t mess up.<br>✔️ Accumulator: produce non-stop, rise in rank.<br>✔️ Endless Mode: what if you could never leave?",
        "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/4b7fa70bc5bc85a3fd831ec4b39998a3.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This is a Job Simulator. Yes, you will be working — a lot!</h2>If you're looking for action, quick thrills or casual gameplay... this might not be for you. But if you enjoy attention to detail, routine, and challenge — welcome to the job.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This game contains jumpscares.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning: This game is based on the universe of another game by the same creator, Doll Impostor. Dolls, boxes, robots, and other elements share the same models, names, and assets. When Doll Impostor is updated, this game will also receive updates, such as new dolls, boxes, and more.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode: Your 30-Day Trial Begins</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.poster.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.webm?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/5dab1d24ccb786984799c7d877e81bc4.mp4?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You've just been hired by Doll INC, the mysterious factory behind the production of Doll Impostor dolls.<br>You have 30 trial days to prove you're fit for the job.<br>Each day brings new tasks, tools, and choices that will test your obedience.<br>Will you follow orders… or dare to disobey?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Job Simulator: Inspect, Scan, Survive</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.poster.avif?t=1781547259\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.webm?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722760/extras/e48b2069eff29242b1bea9346e4ca05d.mp4?t=1781547259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience a unique job simulator: inspect products, scan for defects, operate tools, and detect hidden anomalies.<br>You’ll work with dolls, boxes, and robots—nothing and no one is free from flaws.<br>Learn fast. Act with precision. Your future depends on your performance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Modes: Beyond the Trial</h2>✔️ Worker Mode: endless routine.<br>✔️ Time Attack: speed up, but don’t mess up.<br>✔️ Accumulator: produce non-stop, rise in rank.<br>✔️ Endless Mode: what if you could never leave?",
